FLOOR 8 of 9 - THE END PORTAL

There is no password for locstd08. The End portal opens with an
Eye of Ender, and in this world the Eye is an SSH private key.

The Eye lies in one of the chests of the stronghold, under
/opt/stronghold. The other chests hold junk.

Once you hold the Eye, use it to log in as locstd08 on this same
machine (localhost). The Eye has been lying around far too exposed,
so read carefully what ssh says when you try it.
